www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">″</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><msup><mi>y</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyHard\">H</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Thu, Oct 15th @ 6:20 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:13</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
